The only file that updates constantly, and the only place a unit's state lives. States are
mutually exclusive — nothing is ever in two sections at once. Move lines with `ctx task`
(`add` / `start` / `block` / `done`); it keeps the ledger honest (one unit In progress at a
time, `done` requires concrete details). Hand edits are fine — `ctx lint` checks the invariants.

